Hello everybody! 

Thank you so much for your big and detailed feedback after playing our demo! For the last couple of hours we were working really hard to fix even a small detail to make the gameplay more enjoyable and accessible for all of you. After all, communication with you is one of the most important aspect of our work :) 

Here is the list of changes: 
- Hammer range fixed;
- Hammer Super Hit fixed;
- Hammer Tier 2 fixed;
- Saw range fixed;
- Self-driving car fixed;
- Fixes to collisions;
- Fixes to chests;

Thank you guys! 

